            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Cato the Younger</strong><br>\nCato the Younger was born into a family that was renowned for its political influence and military prowess. From a young age, he was raised with a strict moral code and adherence to the traditional Roman virtues. His education was rigorous, focusing on literature, history, and law, which were considered essential for a career in Roman public life. He was also trained in the art of war, which was a customary practice for young Roman nobles.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rise to the Senate</strong><br>\nCato's early political career was marked by his election to the treasury at a relatively young age, which was the first step on the ladder of the Roman political system. His unyielding stance on corruption and his strict adherence to Roman laws quickly earned him the respect and admiration of his peers. Cato's integrity became a hallmark of his time in public office, setting him apart in an era when bribery and manipulation were commonplace.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Political Philosophy</strong><br>\nCato was a Stoic philosopher, which greatly influenced his political actions and personal ethics. Stoicism, a philosophy that emphasized reason, self-control, and personal virtue, aligned with his austere lifestyle and his commitment to the Republic's wellbeing. His philosophy led him to oppose Julius Caesar's rise to power, fearing that Caesar's ambitions threatened the traditional republican values.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
